# **Anchored.** `data/` unanchored matches a directory named `data` at *any*
# depth, and it silently swallowed `web/src/design-system/components/data/` —
# the DataTable/LoadMore component group. The working tree had the files, every
# local gate passed, and the first fresh checkout of the branch failed to build.
# The dataset directories this is for (`data/postgres`, `data/images`,
# `data/bulk`) are all at the repository root, so the leading slash costs
# nothing and is what was always meant.
/data/

# Per-worktree scratch written by the M9 execution harness
.uvicorn-port

# Usher Console (web/). `package-lock.json` is committed on purpose -- the
# Dockerfile's `npm ci` refuses to run without it, which is what makes the
# image reproducible.
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/dist-fixtures/
web/coverage/
web/test-results/
web/playwright-report/
web/blob-report/
web/.vite/
web/node_modules/.tmp/
